      "text": "Thermal/acoustic insulation material installed in the fuselage must meet the flame propagation test requirements of part II of Appendix F to this part, or other approved equivalent test requirements. This requirement does not apply to &quot;small parts,&quot; as defined in Sec. 23.853(d)(3)(v). -",
